stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NotEnrolled: no Face row in ProfileBiometrics GetEntryGateStatusAsync
    NotEnrolled --> [*]: Allowed false Reason Please enroll your face BiometricVerificationService.cs line 241 to 250
    [*] --> ReadyToAttempt: Face enrolled AttemptsRemaining equals EntryMaxRetries three
    ReadyToAttempt --> Verified: VerifyFaceAsync phase Entry passed true identity score at or above threshold BiometricVerificationService.cs line 158 to 174
    ReadyToAttempt --> Attempt1Failed: identity mismatch or quality rejection recorded as Decision not Pass
    Attempt1Failed --> Verified: next VerifyFaceAsync call passes
    Attempt1Failed --> Attempt2Failed: another failed attempt AttemptsRemaining now one
    Attempt2Failed --> Verified: next VerifyFaceAsync call passes
    Attempt2Failed --> Exhausted: third failed attempt AttemptsRemaining zero BiometricVerificationService.cs line 145 to 147
    Exhausted --> [*]: candidate redirected to VerifyFailed must create a new session fresh attempt budget entry-verify.js line 225 to 231
    Verified --> [*]: Room opens IntegrityPolicy then GenerateQuestionAsync serves first question and charges credit

    note right of ReadyToAttempt
        Voice is never consulted here entry gate is face only BiometricVerificationService.cs line 220 to 223
    end note
    note right of Verified
        Passed state persists for the life of the session GetEntryGateStatusAsync always finds the earlier Pass row on every later re check
